{"completed": true, "response": "```json\n{\n  \"feel\": \"先前悬着的期待渐渐变得温暖、安稳，带着亲近的甜蜜，甚至有些沉醉。但这份甜蜜并不全然轻松，其中有细微的心酸和不舍；越到后面，感情越饱满、热切，经历了一阵近乎满足的喜悦之后，仍有留恋和未尽之意。\",\n  \"thread\": \"先前他很想得到那份珍贵的东西，却还只能小心地期待。现在，他开始真切地尝到这份向往所能带来的快乐。它不再只是一个盼望中的结果，光是感到它如此美好，就已经使他幸福，能够安心地沉浸其中。可这份快乐越真实，他就越想拥有得充分一些、长久一些。原先的珍惜因此多了甜蜜，也多了不舍；那一点心酸并不是快乐被否定了，而是已经尝到了好，却还不能完全尽兴。到了最动情的时候，他确实感到了满足，但那份满足没有使他的愿望消失，反而让他更深地知道自己有多么舍不得。\",\n  \"used\": \"第1段中，他已经怀有强烈而郑重的向往，却尚未得到实际满足；正因十分珍惜，他的期待始终带着谨慎和不安。\",\n  \"new\": [\n    \"这份向往第一次带来了能够真切体会、愿意反复停留其中的快乐，而不再只是对尚未得到之物的迫切期待。\",\n    \"他体验到了一种真实但有限的满足：它使他更加珍惜所求，也使他更清楚，眼前的幸福还不足以让自己完全尽兴。\"\n  ],\n  \"unexplained\": \"无\"\n}\n```", "metadata": {"session_handle": "c71dec2a-5b82-47f7-9309-c1857518be6b", "session_revision": 0, "session_ttl_max_hours": 6, "job_directory": "D:\\musicclaude\\gpt2agent-safechain\\runs\\gpt4\\pro-bridge-20261023T215857110769Z", "elapsed_seconds": 189.266, "completed_utc": "2026-10-23T22:02:06.383798+00:00", "model": "gpt-6-thinking", "thinking_effort": "max", "temporary": true, "unpersonalized": true, "generation_policy_verified": true, "request_policy": {"model": "gpt-6-thinking", "thinking_effort": "max", "history_and_training_disabled": true, "temporary_chat_requests_personalization": false, "is_do_not_remember": false, "continuation": false, "unpersonalized_inherited_verified": false, "body_sha256": "cfc42f19a89022c927223625f590590077a44ce80c4a31c7aeee3094b0a2e3d3", "attachment_count": 0}, "stream_completion": {"sse_done": true, "message_completed": true, "independent_terminal_verified": true}, "profile": "Nozomi Kasaki / gpt4", "account_sha256": "bbd4fd636d4b6714d2b42b89e341bdb5bbe7c34f7d141aec76b444be8343fe54", "transport": "probridge-pure-http", "browser_started": false, "Docker_used": false, "automatic_retry": false, "initializer_pss_limit_mib": "not_applicable_no_browser", "attachment_count": 0, "code_sha256": {"tools\\chatgpt_web\\gpt3_cli.py": "30cf31059194d34457cecf86ec06639767021c07b9a7cda0ca767614c0d702ad", "tools\\chatgpt_web\\gpt3_sessions.py": "83a3ed4ae1efa9f1a2b8ee3f144cc0dc9f668f995a33cc4222308cb3fa31f683", "tools\\chatgpt_web\\gpt3_attachments.py": "eedfa23885000025700f6306b1d1f4582896a7370734be506c156dee532fd7d7"}}, "screenshot_evidence": {"complete": true, "kind": "offline_actual_HTTP_response", "directory": "D:\\musicclaude\\gpt2agent-safechain\\runs\\gpt4\\pro-bridge-20261023T215857110769Z", "files": ["proof-offline.png"], "sha256": {"proof-offline.png": "c758e2b86f4fe7434ed275ad2c12bbd0170837491e1f3ba9b22adaadd3764e42"}}}
